See PR description. Full src/App.jsx must be uploaded from local build (~12415 lines).

Root cause: cross-origin TikTok iframe steals mid-video vertical pans; Android WebView often paints iframes above sibling overlays so a transparent gesture layer never received touches.

Fix summary (VideoPlayer only):
- Gesture overlay with translateZ(0) + slight alpha above iframe
- Native non-passive touchmove forwards dy to [data-fittrack-scroll]
- scrolling=no clips Description/Related
- Short tap peels overlay ~1.8s for Play/Pause
- No modes, no permanent pointer-events:none
- AI Coach / Google Auth / billing / system bars untouched
